%YAML 1.1
%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 7f940b9230e2e114e9d1785277fc8baa, type: 3}
  m_Name: Mysterious_Elder_Conversation
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  dialogueLines: []
  data:
    id: sample-dialogue
    title: Mysterious Elder Conversation
    description: A conversation with an old man guarding ancient ruins.
    startNodeId: node1
    nodes:
    - id: node1
      speaker: Old Man
      text: Halt, traveler! Few dare to wander this close to the Forgotten Ruins.
      posX: 302
      posY: 136
      choices:
      - text: I'm just passing through. I mean no harm.
        nextNodeId: node2
        conditions: []
        effects: []
      - text: What are you guarding, old man?
        nextNodeId: node3
        conditions: []
        effects: []
      - text: Stand aside. I go where I please.
        nextNodeId: node4
        conditions: []
        effects:
        - variableName: elder_respect
          operation: subtract
          value: 1
          variableType: int
      conditions:
        variableName: 
        operatorType: 
        value: 
        variableType: 
    - id: node2
      speaker: Old Man
      text: Many say the same, yet curiosity inevitably draws them closer to the
        ruins. The stones whisper secrets not meant for mortal ears.
      posX: 100
      posY: 350
      choices:
      - text: What kind of secrets?
        nextNodeId: node5
        conditions: []
        effects: []
      - text: I'll be on my way then.
        nextNodeId: node6
        conditions: []
        effects: []
      conditions:
        variableName: 
        operatorType: 
        value: 
        variableType: 
    - id: node3
      speaker: Old Man
      text: I guard nothing... and everything. These ruins hold knowledge from a
        civilization long forgotten. Knowledge that nearly destroyed the world once
        before.
      posX: 400
      posY: 350
      choices:
      - text: Tell me more about this knowledge.
        nextNodeId: node7
        conditions: []
        effects: []
      - text: Has anyone entered the ruins recently?
        nextNodeId: node8
        conditions: []
        effects: []
      conditions:
        variableName: 
        operatorType: 
        value: 
        variableType: 
    - id: node4
      speaker: Old Man
      text: Your arrogance betrays your ignorance. The path you tread is perilous,
        and I will not be responsible for your fate.
      posX: 700
      posY: 350
      choices:
      - text: I apologize for my rudeness.
        nextNodeId: node9
        conditions: []
        effects:
        - variableName: elder_respect
          operation: add
          value: 1
          variableType: int
      - text: I don't need your warnings.
        nextNodeId: node10
        conditions: []
        effects:
        - variableName: ruins_entrance_known
          operation: set
          value: true
          variableType: bool
      conditions:
        variableName: 
        operatorType: 
        value: 
        variableType: 
    - id: node5
      speaker: Old Man
      text: Secrets of power beyond imagination. The ancients knew how to bend reality
        to their will, but their hubris was their downfall.
      posX: 50
      posY: 550
      choices:
      - text: I seek this knowledge for myself.
        nextNodeId: node11
        conditions: []
        effects: []
      - text: Such power should remain buried.
        nextNodeId: node12
        conditions: []
        effects:
        - variableName: elder_respect
          operation: add
          value: 1
          variableType: int
      conditions:
        variableName: 
        operatorType: 
        value: 
        variableType: 
    - id: node6
      speaker: Old Man
      text: Wise choice, traveler. May your journey be safe.
      posX: 200
      posY: 550
      choices: []
      conditions:
        variableName: 
        operatorType: 
        value: 
        variableType: 
    - id: node7
      speaker: Old Man
      text: They say the ancients discovered the language of creation itself. Words
        that could reshape mountains or call forth storms. But as their power grew,
        so did their corruption.
      posX: 350
      posY: 550
      choices:
      - text: How did their civilization fall?
        nextNodeId: node13
        conditions: []
        effects: []
      - text: Do you believe these stories?
        nextNodeId: node14
        conditions: []
        effects: []
      conditions:
        variableName: 
        operatorType: 
        value: 
        variableType: 
    - id: node8
      speaker: Old Man
      text: A scholar from the eastern academy came last season. She never returned.
        Before her, it was a group of treasure hunters. Only one survived, and his
        mind was... changed.
      posX: 550
      posY: 550
      choices:
      - text: Changed how?
        nextNodeId: node15
        conditions: []
        effects: []
      - text: Where is the entrance to the ruins?
        nextNodeId: node16
        conditions:
        - variableName: elder_respect
          operatorType: 
          value: 1
          variableType: int
        effects: []
      conditions:
        variableName: 
        operatorType: 
        value: 
        variableType: 
    - id: node9
      speaker: Old Man
      text: Your humility shows wisdom. Perhaps there is hope for you yet. What brings
        you to these forgotten lands?
      posX: 650
      posY: 550
      choices:
      - text: I'm searching for knowledge about the ancients.
        nextNodeId: node17
        conditions: []
        effects: []
      - text: I'm just a traveler, curious about the world.
        nextNodeId: node18
        conditions: []
        effects: []
      conditions:
        variableName: 
        operatorType: 
        value: 
        variableType: 
    - id: node10
      speaker: Old Man
      text: Then go. The entrance lies beyond the dead tree that weeps red sap. Your
        fate is your own.
      posX: 850
      posY: 550
      choices: []
      conditions:
        variableName: 
        operatorType: 
        value: 
        variableType: 
    - id: node11
      speaker: Old Man
      text: Then you seek your own destruction. Many before you have spoken those
        very words. Their bones now litter the labyrinth below.
      posX: 0
      posY: 750
      choices: []
      conditions:
        variableName: 
        operatorType: 
        value: 
        variableType: 
    - id: node12
      speaker: Old Man
      text: You show unexpected wisdom. Perhaps... wait, what is that around your
        neck?
      posX: 150
      posY: 750
      choices:
      - text: This? Just an old family amulet.
        nextNodeId: node19
        conditions: []
        effects: []
      - text: Nothing of importance.
        nextNodeId: node20
        conditions: []
        effects: []
      conditions:
        variableName: 
        operatorType: 
        value: 
        variableType: 
    - id: node13
      speaker: Old Man
      text: They turned their power against each other. A civil war that lasted three
        days and three nights. When it ended, nothing remained but these ruins and
        the dangerous knowledge buried within.
      posX: 300
      posY: 750
      choices: []
      conditions:
        variableName: 
        operatorType: 
        value: 
        variableType: 
    - id: node14
      speaker: Old Man
      text: I've seen enough in my lifetime to know that every legend contains a
        kernel of truth. And I've heard... whispers... from within the ruins.
      posX: 450
      posY: 750
      choices: []
      conditions:
        variableName: 
        operatorType: 
        value: 
        variableType: 
    - id: node15
      speaker: Old Man
      text: He spoke in riddles, claiming to see beyond the veil of reality. He drew
        symbols that made my eyes hurt to look upon them, before taking his own life
        three days later.
      posX: 600
      posY: 750
      choices: []
      conditions:
        variableName: 
        operatorType: 
        value: 
        variableType: 
    - id: node16
      speaker: Old Man
      text: Your respect has earned you truth. Beyond the three standing stones,
        where the morning sun casts no shadow, there is a path. Follow it to your
        destiny... or your doom.
      posX: 750
      posY: 750
      choices:
      - text: Thank you. I will proceed with caution.
        nextNodeId: node21
        conditions: []
        effects:
        - variableName: ruins_entrance_known
          operation: set
          value: true
          variableType: bool
      conditions:
        variableName: 
        operatorType: 
        value: 
        variableType: 
    - id: node17
      speaker: Old Man
      text: Knowledge, always knowledge. But to what end? Power? Enlightenment? The
        line between the two is thinner than you might think.
      posX: 300
      posY: 950
      choices: []
      conditions:
        variableName: 
        operatorType: 
        value: 
        variableType: 
    - id: node18
      speaker: Old Man
      text: Curiosity is both a blessing and a curse. It drives us forward, yet often
        leads us to places we should not go.
      posX: 450
      posY: 950
      choices: []
      conditions:
        variableName: 
        operatorType: 
        value: 
        variableType: 
    - id: node19
      speaker: Old Man
      text: That is no ordinary amulet. It bears the sigil of the Ancient Guardians.
        How came you by such an artifact?
      posX: 100
      posY: 950
      choices:
      - text: It was passed down through generations in my family.
        nextNodeId: node22
        conditions: []
        effects: []
      conditions:
        variableName: 
        operatorType: 
        value: 
        variableType: 
    - id: node20
      speaker: Old Man
      text: You lie poorly. That amulet marks you as... No, it cannot be. After all
        these centuries...
      posX: 250
      posY: 950
      choices: []
      conditions:
        variableName: 
        operatorType: 
        value: 
        variableType: 
    - id: node21
      speaker: Old Man
      text: 'Remember this warning: what lies below responds to intention as much
        as action. A pure heart may pass where a corrupt one will be destroyed.'
      posX: 700
      posY: 950
      choices: []
      conditions:
        variableName: 
        operatorType: 
        value: 
        variableType: 
    - id: node22
      speaker: Old Man
      text: Then perhaps our meeting is no coincidence. The prophecy speaks of a
        descendent who would return when the stars align once more... which they
        do tonight.
      posX: 100
      posY: 1150
      choices: []
      conditions:
        variableName: 
        operatorType: 
        value: 
        variableType: 
  relatedTask: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 5953d12baff1dcc49b2e35999778ca6c, type: 2}
